OverTheWire Bandit: Level 20 → 21

Objective
Retrieve the password for Level 21.
A program listens on a TCP port and expects the Level 20 password to be sent to it.

Steps
Log in as bandit20:
ssh bandit20@bandit.labs.overthewire.org -p 2220
Start a listener on a chosen port (example: 1234):
nc -lvp 1234
In another terminal, run the provided binary and point it to the listener:
./suconnect 1234
Send the Bandit 20 password through the listener.

Result
The program responds with the password for Bandit Level 21.
